# This repo tracks TOOLING + the drift baseline ONLY. Never source. Never reports.

# Cloned fleet source — re-derived from roster.sh, never committed (this is the
# exact category that made dev-audit a liability).
repos
repos/

# Derived reports/inventory — regenerable from the scanners; go stale instantly.
# Keep ONLY drift-policy.json (the ratchet ledger).
ecosystem-inventory/*
!ecosystem-inventory/drift-policy.json

# Synthesis / segment outputs are reports — keep them out of version control.
segment-*.md
_governance-ssot*.md
*-report.md

# Credentials / secrets — never committed under any circumstances.
*.pem
*.env
.env.local
org-tokens.json

# Standard
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
